    "position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    }
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "といってもうちの学校かなり広いからね、一日でぜんぶ廻るのは無理かな"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "今日は生徒会室までの道すがら、おおまかなとこだけ説明するね"
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/1/habit-9.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "わたしたちが今いるのは新校舎で、ちょっと離れた位置にむかしの校舎――旧校舎が建ってるけど、今はあんまり使われてないの"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "新校舎の外には他にもいろいろあるから、近いうちに案内したげるよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "新校舎は中庭を挟んでＡ棟、Ｂ棟にわかれてて、廊下で繋がってる"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "Ａ棟の奥にプールと体育館があって、この時間――放課後は部活で使われてるかな"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "play_voice",
    "asset_code": "web:voice/character/1/emo_embarrassed-2.wav"
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "Ａ棟は主に教室があるね、わたしたち二年生は三階。って、これは言わなくてももう知ってるよね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "図書室とか音楽室とか、主な特別教室はＢ棟にあるから、覚えておいて"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "生徒会室はＢ棟の四階だったかな。けっこう地の果てというか遠いから、たくさん歩くよ"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/joyful",
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "ん？　あぁ、そうかもね。校舎のどこに何があるかはけっこう詳しいよ――わたし、美術部だから"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": null,
    "expression_position": {
      "x": 4,
      "y": 518
    },
    "active": true
  },
  {
    "command": "talk",
    "speaker": "なつみ",
    "text": "校内のあちこち移動して、デッサンとかするんだよね"
  },
  {
    "command": "update_character",
    "id": "center",
    "character": 1,
    "dress": "default",
    "pose": "1",
    "expression": "default_expression/amazed",
